<title>UK: Barclays buys back another 1.5 mln shrs.</title>
<headline>Barclays buys back another 1.5 mln shrs.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Barclays Plc said on Thursday it had purchased for cancellation another 1.5 million shares at a price of 1,132.26 pence per share.</p>
<p>The purchase is part of Barclays' plans to buy back 26 million ordinary shares representing around 1.7 percent of its issued ordinary share capital.</p>
<p>The British bank announced the plans on Wednesday and bought 9.2 million shares on the same day at 1,137.27 pence each.</p>
<p>Barclays said it had bought Friday's lot of shares from BZW Securities.</p>
<p>Its share price was trading 3-1/2 p lower at 1,123 1/2 pence at 0830 gmt on Friday.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7717</p>
